%% Current ordering; remote delivery and renewal require separate evidence.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant T as bloom-tui
    participant D as bloomd service
    participant E as External engine via Dart
    participant S as Encrypted store
    Note over T,E: Text send, acceptance is not delivery
    U->>T: Compose and press Enter
    T->>D: Send or StartConversation request
    D->>D: Validate identity, recipients and text
    D->>E: Correlated text send
    E-->>D: Accepted message ID or error/uncertain timeout
    alt Accepted
        D->>S: Persist outgoing message as Sent
        D-->>T: Publish message event and return accepted ID
        T->>T: Correlate attempt/message ID, never guess target
    else Rejected or uncertain
        D-->>T: Protocol result
        T->>U: Preserve draft, uncertain outcome needs manual check
    end
    Note over D,E: A persistence failure after acceptance does not undo the remote send
    Note over T,E: Inbound message
    E-->>D: Decoded message event
    D->>S: Idempotent ingest and commit
    D-->>T: Publish after persistence
    T->>U: Render stored message
    Note over T,E: Metadata sync is not remote message import
    T->>D: SyncConversations request
    D->>E: Correlated metadata listing
    E-->>D: Conversation rows then complete/limited/failed
    D->>S: Await persistence barrier
    D-->>T: Refresh event and sync receipt
    Note over T,E: Engine failure reports degraded/disconnected, no automatic generation restart
